<section class="section" id="planner"><div class="container"><div class="row g-5 align-items-start"><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="section-label mb-3">01 — Your brief</div><h2 class="intro-title">Mwambie mbunifu wako unachotaka.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-secondary lh-lg">Huhitaji kutengeneza room list. Andika tu matumizi, lifestyle, privacy, spaces unazotamani na muonekano unaoupenda. AI itatoa spaces na vipimo vya awali kutoka kwenye maelezo hayo.</p><div class="mt-4 p-4 border-start border-3" style="border-color:var(--green)!important;background:#eee9df"><strong>Tip</strong><div class="note mt-2">Mfano: “Nataka nyumba ya familia ya kisasa, master yenye privacy, bedrooms za watoto, living kubwa, kitchen, dining, veranda na parking ya magari mawili...”</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-8"><form id="plannerForm" class="paper planner-card"><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Jina la project</label><input name="project" class="form-control" placeholder="Mfano: My Family House"></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Jina la mteja <span class="text-secondary">(optional)</span></label><input name="client" class="form-control" placeholder="Jina lako"></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Contact <span class="text-secondary">(optional)</span></label><input name="contact" class="form-control" placeholder="Simu / email"></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Location <span class="text-secondary">(optional)</span></label><input name="location" class="form-control" placeholder="Mji / eneo"></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Plot width (m) *</label><input name="plot_width" type="number" step="0.1" min="1" class="form-control" placeholder="20" required></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Plot depth (m) *</label><input name="plot_depth" type="number" step="0.1" min="1" class="form-control" placeholder="30" required></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Road side</label><select name="road_side" class="form-select"><option>North</option><option>South</option><option>East</option><option>West</option></select></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Style preference <span class="text-secondary">(optional)</span></label><select name="style" class="form-select"><option value="">AI iamue kulingana na brief</option><option>Modern Tropical</option><option>Contemporary</option><option>Luxury</option><option>Minimalist</option><option>Courtyard</option><option>African Tropical</option></select></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">Maelezo ya mteja *</label><textarea name="brief" class="form-control" required placeholder="Eleza nyumba unayotaka kwa lugha yako. Usijali room list au vipimo — AI itatoa spaces na dimensions kutoka kwenye maelezo yako."></textarea></div><div class="col-12 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-3 pt-2"><div class="note">* Plot dimensions na brief pekee ndizo muhimu. Concept hii ni preliminary planning.</div><button class="btn btn-main" type="submit"><span class="btn-text">Tengeneza architectural concept</span><span class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm d-none" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div></div></form></div></div></div></section>
