<section class="section process" id="method"><div class="container"><div class="row g-5"><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="section-label text-light opacity-75 mb-3">03 — The method</div><h2 class="display-5">Kutoka brief mpaka architectural concept.</h2><p class="mt-3 text-white-50 lh-lg">AI backend yako iliyopo ndiyo inabaki kufanya analysis. UI hii ni presentation layer mpya juu yake.</p></div><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="step"><small>01</small><h4>Inasoma brief</h4><div class="text-white-50">Inaelewa matumizi, lifestyle, privacy na priorities.</div></div><div class="step"><small>02</small><h4>Inatambua spaces</h4><div class="text-white-50">Room list haijaandikwa kwa mkono; AI ina-extract spaces kutoka kwenye maelezo.</div></div><div class="step"><small>03</small><h4>Inapanga dimensions</h4><div class="text-white-50">Vipimo vinaamuliwa kulingana na function, plot na circulation.</div></div><div class="step"><small>04</small><h4>Inatengeneza presentation</h4><div class="text-white-50">Floor plan, dimensions, room flow na exterior concept vinaonyeshwa pamoja.</div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section id="results" class="result"><div class="result-head"><div class="container"><div class="section-label text-white-50 mb-3">Architectural concept</div><h2 id="rTitle" class="display-4">Concept</h2><p id="rSummary" class="lead text-white-50 mb-0"></p></div></div><div class="section"><div class="container"><div id="clarify" class="alert alert-warning d-none"></div><div class="row g-4 mb-4"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="result-card"><div class="section-label">House width</div><div id="houseW" class="metric">—</div><div class="note">metres</div></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="result-card"><div class="section-label">House depth</div><div id="houseD" class="metric">—</div><div class="note">metres</div></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="result-card"><div class="section-label">Spaces extracted</div><div id="roomCount" class="metric">—</div><div class="note">from your brief</div></div></div></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="result-card"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3"><h3 class="mb-0">Floor plan concept</h3><span class="note">Preliminary</span></div><div class="floor-wrap"><div id="floor" class="floor"></div></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="result-card"><h3>Dimensions</h3><div id="dimensions" class="mt-3"></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="result-card"><h3>Room flow</h3><div id="flow" class="mt-3"></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="result-card"><h3>Exterior concept</h3><p id="outside" class="text-secondary lh-lg mt-3"></p></div></div><div class="col-12"><div class="result-card"><h3>Architectural note</h3><p class="text-secondary lh-lg mb-0">Hii ni concept ya awali ya space planning. Setbacks, structure, drainage, soil conditions, local regulations na construction documentation vinapaswa kuthibitishwa na architect/engineer mwenye sifa kabla ya ujenzi.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
